### ==============================================
### EXPECTED RESPONSES
### ==============================================

### Success Response (200 OK)
### {
###   "message": "Records Has updated and Notification sends to User"
### }

### Error Response (400 Bad Request)
### {
###   "message": "RequestID is required"
### }

### Error Response (500 Internal Server Error)
### {
###   "message": "Error In Updating Table and Notify users"
### }

### ==============================================
### WHAT THIS API DOES
### ==============================================
### 1. Updates all pending approvals to "Cancelled" status
### 2. Sets approval.CancelledBy and approval.CancelledOn
### 3. Updates request.CurrentStatusId to "Cancelled"
### 4. Sets request.CompletedOn
### 5. Returns list of approvers to notify
### 6. Logs notifications (actual sending would be in notification service)

### ==============================================
### DATABASE CHANGES
### ==============================================
### Tables Modified:
### - Approval: CancelledBy, CancelledOn, PositionStatusId
### - Request: CompletedOn, CurrentStatusId
###
### Only affects records where:
### - RequestId matches input
### - Approval.PositionStatusId = 'afa75c70-c92d-f111-88b3-7c1e523ac2bc' (Pending)

### ==============================================
### POWER PLATFORM COMPARISON
### ==============================================
### Original Power Platform API URL:
### https://94dc3aefc027e3d1ace7ec4cd6d9dd.d1.environment.api.powerplatform.com:443/powerautomate/automations/direct/workflows/8619c5bf0fa4405ebd85a9dc78cfbeb7/triggers/manual/paths/invoke?api-version=1
###
### This .NET API provides the same functionality:
### - Updates approval and request records
### - Returns success/error messages
### - Prepares notification data
### - Uses transactions for data consistency
